        <mxCell id="lambda-handler-content" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;" value="&lt;b&gt;Processing:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Parses _progress.json / manifest.json&lt;br&gt;• Updates Redis (state tracking: xena:job:{jobId})&lt;br&gt;• Builds observability event payload&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Event Structure:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;{ eventType, timestamp, job: {jobId, library, ...}, execution: {...} }&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; Enqueues to SQS observability queue" vertex="1">
